/// Spike 2: runs a block in another process and answers what it raised
/// (or nil), so a test can use an exchange from a non-owner. Spike-only.
typed Actor subclass: SpikeRunner

  run: block :: Block(Object) -> Object =>
    [
      block value
      nil
    ] on: Exception do: [:e | e]
